    "text": "For the sea areas extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota and from Chilaw to Kankasanthurai via Puttalam. PLEASE BE PREPARED! The sea areas off the coasts extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota and from Chilaw to Kankasanthurai via Puttalam will be rough at times with strong gusty winds up to (50-60) kmph. Naval and fishing communities are requested to be vigilant and be attentive to future forecasts issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
